lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯发布HY-Embodied-0.5具身模型，22项评测中16项刷新行业纪录</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">教育部等五部门印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》并开发全学段AI慕课</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta发布Muse Spark模型，推动Meta AI应用跃升至App Store第五名</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">西门子联手英伟达优化AI芯片验证流程，将前硅设计验证周期从数月缩短至数日</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">西门子与英伟达近日宣布在AI芯片验证领域达成深度合作，通过软硬协同技术，将芯片前硅设计验证周期从数月大幅缩短至数日。该方案核心采用西门子Veloce™ proFPGA CS硬件辅助验证系统，配合英伟达深度优化的芯片架构进行实战模拟。通过在首版芯片制造前运行大规模真实工作负载，双方实现了对数万亿次设计周期的极速验证。此举不仅能显著缩短AI芯片的上市时间（TTM），还能通过提前“试错”有效提升流片成功率，规避高昂的返工成本。西门子通过其EDA工具链与数字化孪生技术，为英伟达的高算力密度芯片提供了关键的验证保障。这一合作标志着工业软件在AI底层产业链中的深度渗透，为下一代AI算力集群的快速落地提供了技术支撑，进一步加速了高性能AI硬件的研发迭代进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团斩获CVPR 2026两项冠军，实现AIGC检测技术实战级跃迁</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b6a01cf851f6683de7de460ae590134a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团在计算机视觉顶会CVPR 2026 NTIRE挑战赛中，斩获“复杂真实场景鲁棒性样本测试”与“人脸增强异常检测”双赛道冠军。针对Deepfake与AIGC滥用风险，蚂蚁AI安全实验室基于DINOv3视觉基础模型，提出双流并行集成架构，通过模拟多重失真全链路退化效果，显著提升了模型在真实场景下的鲁棒性。团队创新采用“Locate-Then-Examine”两阶段检测范式，不仅能识别AI生成内容，还能定位伪造瑕疵并生成文本解释，突破了传统“黑盒”检测局限。该技术已应用于支付、金融身份认证及EKYC等场景，为防范深度伪造攻击提供关键保障。此外，团队已在GitHub开源相关检测资源仓库，助力行业共同应对AI安全挑战。此次夺冠标志着蚂蚁集团AIGC检测能力从实验室环境向复杂真实场景的成功跃迁，为金融级内容安全审核</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布HY-Embodied-0.5具身模型，22项评测中16项刷新行业纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8463332e50e07be255cca58cf0c03ac7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯Robotics X实验室联合腾讯混元团队正式发布具身智能基础模型HY-Embodied-0.5，旨在解决通用视觉语言模型在物理交互中的感知与控制痛点。该系列包含MoT-2B端侧模型与MoE-32B旗舰模型，采用首创的视觉与语言模态非共享参数的混合Transformer架构，并集成HY-ViT2.0视觉编码器。模型基于超1亿条具身专属数据训练，通过拒绝采样微调与在线蒸馏等策略优化。性能方面，MoT-2B在22项感知、推理及规划评测中斩获16项最佳，超越Qwen3-VL-4B等同参数竞品；MoE-32B则具备与Gemini3.0Pro抗衡的综合性能。实机测试显示，该模型在打包、堆叠等物理任务中表现优异，为具身智能从仿真走向物理实操提供了高性能底层基座，标志着大模型认知链路正式延伸至机器人控制领域。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">教育部等五部门印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》并开发全学段AI慕课</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6eed16a7e538262afb05d56267905cf5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">教育部、国家发展改革委、工业和信息化部、科技部及国家数据局联合印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》，正式启动国家级全学段AI慕课资源开发。该计划旨在构建全民AI素养培育机制，确保教育资源公平。在实施路径上，基础教育阶段将AI课程设为地方必修课，侧重智能思维启蒙；高等教育将AI纳入公共基础课程，增设微专业与微证书；职业教育则聚焦产业智能转型，培养高技能人才。国家智慧教育平台将上线免费AI通识课，集成智能导学、个性化路径规划及AI伴学等技术，通过数字化手段弥合城乡教育鸿沟。此举标志着我国AI人才培养进入体系化阶段，旨在通过供给侧改革重塑劳动力结构。预计到2030年，人工智能将从精英工具转化为社会基础性技能，为我国在全球AI竞争中储备深厚的人才池与应用生态基础。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布Muse Spark模型，推动Meta AI应用跃升至App Store第五名</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4f4fe424bc7d4464a7e82b11016ac757.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta公司正式推出由Alexandr Wang领导的超级智能实验室研发的Muse Spark模型，该模型支持语音、文本和图像多模态输入，具备解答复杂科学问题及视觉编程能力，并支持多子代理协同处理任务。受此驱动，Meta AI应用在美国App Store排名从第57名飙升至第5名。Appfigures数据显示，发布首日其美国iOS下载量达4.6万次，环比增长87%。Meta AI应用目前全球总下载量已达6050万，印度为最大市场。此外，Meta AI网页端4月8日日均访问量激增超450%。该模型将陆续集成至WhatsApp、Instagram、Facebook、Messenger及Meta AI眼镜等平台。尽管下载量显著增长，Meta AI在行业排名中仍落后于ChatGPT、Claude和Gemini。目前，M</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
